# Fernbedienung against a pretend Steckfeld: the waiting screens, ACK, an Edit screen (filter), Route with its
# cables, the patch list, a macro with unsnapshotted changes, the settings page, the dark theme, the crews' later
# modules, a protocol mismatch
midiout 1
frames 70
screen build/host/out/fb_nousb.ppm
usbup 1
usbtone 440 -12
frames 30
screen build/host/out/fb_wait.ppm
# the hands before Steckfeld answers: CCs go out all the same
knob K1 2
knob SELECT -1
frames 2
# Steckfeld starts: ASK_HELLO, the FM-1 says HELLO, ACK (light), the full state
sysex F0 7D 46 42 7F  F7
sysex F0 7D 46 42 02 01 01 F7
